{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736455866622017587","content":"Web nods at the archivist kindly. \n\"From what I understand Kiln is suspicious of me based on the fact that she heard the voice of Skitter from behind me while I was helping her with the autopsy. I do not know exactly why, but a strange insect appears behind my ear and talks in Skitter's voice whenever I am about to look at the results of violence. I am willing to demonstrate this to the court, as Amara and I have discovered that that includes the burn on her hand. I was intending to speak to Archivist Daysong about this today, so he may be able to shed some light on the nature of this insect.\"\n\"I do not know of its origin or why it appears at these moments.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T19:42:48.956000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738119359737888768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
